# DreamSeed SSH Hardening
PasswordAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
MaxAuthTries 3
MaxSessions 10
ClientAliveCountMax 2
LogLevel VERBOSE
AllowUsers {{ ansible_user | default('ubuntu') }}
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
ClientAliveInterval 300
UseDNS no
Compression no
TCPKeepAlive no
Banner /etc/issue.net
